# LENS DESIGN SYSTEM — MANDATORY (KB-FIRST)

This project EXCLUSIVELY uses Lens (`@loomhq/lens@12.14.0`).

## KB-FIRST LOOKUP ORDER (MANDATORY)

When you are unsure about a component/prop/token:

1. **Quick usage & key rules:** @.lens-knowledge-base/QUICK-REFERENCE.md
2. **Find the right component doc:** @.lens-knowledge-base/COMPONENT-INDEX.md
3. **Read the component file:** @.lens-knowledge-base/components/<ComponentName>.md
4. **Tokens router:** @.lens-knowledge-base/tokens/_tokens-index.md
5. **Then token file:** @.lens-knowledge-base/tokens/*.md
6. **Verified exports:** @.lens-knowledge-base/exports-verified.json
7. **Only if still unclear:** https://lens.loom.dev

### IMPORTANT
- Do NOT open `.lens-knowledge-base/reference/components-full.md` or other giant reference files unless steps 1–6 fail.
- Prefer the small index files + per-component docs.

## Core Lens primitives (actual Lens, verified)
- Layout: `Container`, `Split`, `Arrange`, `Align`, `Spacer`, `Backdrop`
- Typography: `Text` (covers headings via size + htmlTag)
- Icons: `Icon` + `@loomhq/lens/icons/*` subpath imports
- Spacing tokens: xsmall/small/medium/large/xlarge/xxlarge

## Forbidden
- Inline `style={{...}}` (always forbidden)
- Non-Lens className (only Lens utility classes allowed)
- Competing UI libs (MUI, Chakra, Tailwind, etc.)
